# HTTP headers applied by Cloudflare Workers' static-asset serving.
# Vite copies `public/_headers` verbatim into `dist/`, and Cloudflare
# Workers' assets pipeline reads it as a route → header map.
#
# `frame-ancestors` MUST be an HTTP header — the CSP spec disallows it
# from <meta http-equiv> tags. /embed is a public, read-only embeddable
# widget (no auth), so it is framable by any origin. (The obsolete
# X-Frame-Options: ALLOW-FROM header was dropped — no current browser
# honors ALLOW-FROM, and it could be read as a deny that blocks framing.)

/embed
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *

/embed.html
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *
